  "description": "Installation of a roof-mounted solar PV system on the main pitched roof and garage roof of the residential property located at 14 Chichester Close, London E6 5QJ, comprising:\n\n32 all-black Aiko 460W panels on the main pitched roof (total of 14.7kW capacity), and\n\n9 all-black Aiko 460W panels integrated into the garage roof (additional system capacity 4.14kW).\n\nThe complete system therefore comprises 41 panels in total, with an overall combined system capacity of 18.84kW.\n\nThe installation includes a Fox 10.5kW hybrid inverter and two Fox EP5 5.18kW heated battery storage units, together with all associated cabling, electrical components, labelling, and protective bird mesh. Scaffolding will be erected on two sides of the property to facilitate installation.\n\nNo structural alterations to the building or garage are proposed. All works will be carried out in compliance with MCS, G99, and NICEIC standards.",
